@startuml

title Auth Register Flow

actor User
participant "API" as API
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "MailService" as Mail
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "JwtService" as JWT

== 檢查 Email ==

User -> API : POST /auth/check-email\n{ email }
API -> UserRepo : ExistsByEmail(email)

alt Email 已存在
    API --> User : 400 此 Email 已註冊過
end

API --> User : 200 OK

== 發送 OTP ==

User -> API : POST /auth/send-otp\n{ email }
API -> API : 產生 6 位數 OTP
API -> Redis : SET otp:{email} {otp} EX 300
note right : TTL 5 分鐘，重複發送會覆蓋舊的
API -> Mail : SendOtp(email, otp)
API --> User : 200 OK

== 註冊 ==

User -> API : POST /auth/register\n{ email, otp, password, name, phone }
API -> Redis : GET otp:{email}

alt key 不存在（OTP 過期或未發送）
    API --> User : 400 OTP 已過期，請重新發送
else OTP 不正確
    API --> User : 400 OTP 不正確
end

API -> Redis : DEL otp:{email}
API -> UserRepo : Create(name, email, phone, passwordHash)
API -> JWT : GenerateTokens(userId)
API --> User : 200 { accessToken, refreshToken }

@enduml
